## Summary of Changes

### New `localCode` data property
- `null` by default → `effectiveCode` falls through to the `code` prop
- Set whenever the user produces a new version (patch result, manual edit)
- Cleared after a successful save to stay in sync with the prop

### New `effectiveCode` computed
Replaces all direct `this.code` reads in display/save logic — single source of truth for "what code are we working with right now"

### New `applyUserChange(newContent)` method
Central funnel for all change sources:
- Sets `localCode`
- Seeds `diffEditContent` with the new version
- Opens the diff view automatically so the user sees **disk vs new** and can validate/edit before saving

### Fixed `applyPatchFromAI`
Now calls `applyUserChange(response.content)` instead of trying to mutate the `code` prop — the diff view opens immediately after the API call returns

### Fixed `applyMessageChange`
Also routes through `applyUserChange` so manual Monaco edits get the same diff-review flow

### New `resetLocalChanges` / Reset button
Lets the user abandon patch/edit results and go back to the original AI-generated prop value

